          </y:NodeLabel>
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="left" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Adwaita Sans" fontSize="15" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" height="131.0458984375" horizontalTextPosition="center" iconTextGap="4" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#5A4F3E" verticalTextPosition="bottom" visible="true" width="405.22802734375" x="-2.989013671875" xml:space="preserve" y="-10.52294921875">
            1. make_scene() → detect objects
            2. Calculate pickup &amp; placement coordinates
